> **Give DeepSeek V4 Flash test-time scaling: V4 Flash + Bo5 self-verification reaches Fable-5-level scores** — 88% on Terminal-Bench 2.1, frontier-model accuracy at a fraction of the cost (≈11× cheaper).

An independent dsh-native implementation of the test-time selection method from [LLM-as-a-Verifier](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.05391) (arXiv:2607.05391, MIT). Method by the paper's authors; this implementation by [Aispin](https://github.com/aispin-dev).
